<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all repos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all repos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico concluded all 10 repurchase agreements whereby it sought to drain 6.423 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The repurchase agreements were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	100 million  338 days   24.50 pct</p>
<p>	100 million  181 days   23.49 pct</p>
<p>	100 million   89 days   23.45 pct</p>
<p>	900 million   14 days   25.23 pct</p>
<p>	900 million   13 days   25.64 pct</p>
<p>	950 million   12 days   26.11 pct</p>
<p>	950 million    9 days   25.99 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln    6 days   25.93 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln    5 days   25.88 pct</p>
<p>	423 million    1 day    25.73 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
